I now have a thorough understanding of the entire project. Here is a complete report of all findings.

---

## COMPLETE PROJECT STRUCTURE ANALYSIS

---

### 1. OVERALL FOLDER STRUCTURE

```
C:\Users\yanya\WebstormProjects\OpenGlimpse\
  .env                          # DB_NAME=openglimpse, DB_USER=postgres, DB_PASSWORD=password, PORT=3001
  .gitignore
  AGENTS.md                     # Agent rules: no excessive comments, route in index.js, module code in module folder
  package-lock.json
